  "findings": [
    "One original Back touch still precedes the entire observation loop. The patch adds no input, route opening, filesystem cleanup or repeated action.",
    "Every retry freshly observes native PID and foreground Activity. An empty later mailbox alone cannot replace native process exit and the existing required MainActivity/package match.",
    "The complete mailbox find command and parent directory remain unchanged. Any state.json, including a foreign token, prevents acceptance; the patch does not filter away remaining files.",
    "A successful empty find is accepted only after unchanged stdout-size/returncode/stderr checks, the global remaining-budget check, and the added local time.monotonic() >= deadline rejection.",
    "The existing local deadline remains 45 seconds and rejects completion exactly at or after its boundary. The existing per-command timeout remains globally bounded; this is an acceptance deadline, not a new hard local mid-command cancellation mechanism.",
    "Every returned find/Activity/PID response remains a separately numbered original receipt. The final item binds the fresh successful read paths, retaining all earlier nonempty observations.",
    "The unchanged tail still validates owner and durable round, record revision, board, rules and reward data, then requires the paused Flutter UI and the existing single leave-to-games touch with fresh control observations."
  ],
